 good: the rook first, then the c pawn. } 9. Nc3 c5 { Level: your rook on b8 and your c pawn both press on his queen side. [%cal Gb8b2] }) (8... h6 { Just as good: a quiet waiting move. } 9. Nc3 c5 { Level: your c pawn still gets to c5 and hits d4. [%cal Gc5d4] }) 0-1


